# Level 3 "Nile Catwalks" completion (maps/level3.vmap, layout and
# coordinates in maps/src/level3.txt), skill 2. High-level commands only.
# goto does not path through a closed door, so each door is opened by hand
# (goto the tile in front, face, use, wait 32).
